Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.70,Short,,0,0,0,,That growl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:01.62,Short,,0,0,0,,isn't your stomach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.06,Short,,0,0,0,,begging for food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:03.72,Short,,0,0,0,,It's your gut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:04.70,Short,,0,0,0,,cleaning house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:05.87,Short,,0,0,0,,When your stomach's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.32,Short,,0,0,0,,been empty for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:07.84,Short,,0,0,0,,about every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:08.86,Short,,0,0,0,,hour and a half
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.78,Short,,0,0,0,,a powerful wave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.34,Short,,0,0,0,,of muscle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.46,Short,,0,0,0,,squeezes through it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:11.98,Short,,0,0,0,,and down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:13.22,Short,,0,0,0,,your intestines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:13.80,Short,,0,0,0,,sweeping out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.06,Short,,0,0,0,,leftover scraps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:16.82,Short,,0,0,0,,With no food inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.58,Short,,0,0,0,,that wave pushes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.92,Short,,0,0,0,,only gas and liquid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.54,Short,,0,0,0,,so the bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.24,Short,,0,0,0,,squeeze through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:20.72,Short,,0,0,0,,the tubes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:21.28,Short,,0,0,0,,and echo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:21.96,Short,,0,0,0,,like water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.88,Short,,0,0,0,,in old pipes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.16,Short,,0,0,0,,Doctors call it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.23,Short,,0,0,0,,borborygmi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:25.60,Short,,0,0,0,,It happens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.56,Short,,0,0,0,,after meals too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.12,Short,,0,0,0,,but food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:28.50,Short,,0,0,0,,muffles the sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.34,Short,,0,0,0,,And hunger hormones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:30.20,Short,,0,0,0,,can set the wave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.18,Short,,0,0,0,,off early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:31.80,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:32.42,Short,,0,0,0,,it roars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.34,Short,,0,0,0,,in a silent room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:33.92,Short,,0,0,0,,relax
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.30,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.95,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwhose stomach growls in exams
